      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WILDASH JANE (4) is a talented dog who is a winner of nine races but missed the frame last time when fifth at Q Parklands (30.32). Has claims if she runs up to expectations. HARA'S AMBER (6) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this track and trip which boasts two wins and two placings. Comes off a (20.19) win last time, scoring by 3.5 lengths in a Grade 6 over 366m at this track. Looks suited here and can measure up. UNCLE JOE (3) hit the ground running and on speed early but faded out of it to finish fourth (19.31) at Q Straight over 350m. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. STRIKING BEACH (1) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
